   "upstream_file": "54540807 - play calling by package fixed TU1.1.patch.toml",
   "upstream_sha256": "dccf039bf84e807d0f35b97638aaa797a83b7bb4338aa9771d305651b2cdcf23",
   "name": "Play calling by package fixed: every package selectable + package applies to every formation; Punt/Field Goal/kicking packages open their own formations",
   "upstream_desc": "The formation list, stepper and card builder walk the whole tab (every formation) for scrimmage packages, but for the special-teams packages (categories 15-25: Punt, Punt Return, Field Goal, Block FG, Kickoff etc.) they walk only that package formations, so Punt and Field Goal open the punt / field-goal formations (stub at 0x84D0D500); the package is no longer cleared when the shown formation is outside it (0x84A27DE4) or on up/down (0x84A2A448). The package picker (0x84A2DD30/0x84A2DDB4, and the matching counter at 0x84A2D3E8/0x84A2D428/0x84A2D408) temporarily advertises all 28 categories while it lists packages, so every package appears even if the playbook has no formation using it. Uses caves 0x84D0D400..0x84D0D4E4 and 0x84D0D500..0x84D0D568.",
   "desc": "The formation list, stepper and card builder walk the whole tab (every formation) for scrimmage packages, but for the special-teams packages (categories 15-25: Punt, Punt Return, Field Goal, Block FG, Kickoff etc.) they walk only that package formations, so Punt and Field Goal open the punt / field-goal formations (stub at 0x84D0DA80); the package is no longer cleared when the shown formation is outside it (0x84A27DE4) or on up/down (0x84A2A448). The package picker (0x84A2DD30/0x84A2DDB4, and the matching counter at 0x84A2D3E8/0x84A2D428/0x84A2D408) temporarily advertises all 28 categories while it lists packages, so every package appears even if the playbook has no formation using it. Uses caves 0x84D0D980..0x84D0DA64 and 0x84D0DA80..0x84D0DAE8. Relocated by APF 2K8 Mod Studio from 0x84D0D400..0x84D0D567 (owned by the Studio's charge-abilities patch) into Studio-reserved space; branch offsets were rewritten, every other word is unchanged.",
