  {
   "key": "all_packages_in_substitution",
   "filename": "54540807-basileus-all-packages-in-substitution.patch.toml",
   "upstream_file": "54540807 - all packages in substitution menu TU1.1.patch.toml",
   "upstream_sha256": "eac0d0f9f71189344ba43c4863869f23b856ae54318635e2bc3096115c47c4f5",
   "name": "All packages in substitution menu: Substitution screen lists every package (main menu and in game) in a custom order",
   "upstream_desc": "(1) 0x84A7041C: the playbook-independent second pass accepts every package, not just special teams. (2) 0x84A70468 -> stub 0x84D0D580: Trio (row 5) has no formation in MASTER, so it borrows formation 107 (Ace Trips Open). (3) 0x84A703EC: the second pass also runs in game (the stock code skips it in game, which is why Trio and a few others were missing there). (4) 0x84A70484 -> sort stub 0x84D0D5A0 reorders the finished list with a rank table at 0x84D0D680: Load, Jacks, Jokers, Pro Set, Queens, Ace, Kings, Flush, Trio, Straight, 5 Wide, Goalline, 5-2 Big, 4-3, 3-4, Nickel, Nickel 3-3, Dime, Dime 3-2, Prevent, Punt, Punt Return, Field Goal, Block FG, Kickoff, Kick Return, Onside Kickoff Team, Onside Kickoff Return Team (5) 0x84A707BC -> sort stub 0x84D0D6A0: after the By Formation list is built, each formation is moved right behind the last earlier formation of its family (family table at 0x84D0DB00, generated from the game's own same-row test), so newly added formations sit with their parents; Hail Mary is left alone. Also uses 0x84D0D6A0..0x84D0D7E7, 0x84D0DB00..0x84D0DBAF and 0x84D0D580..0x84D0D593, 0x84D0D5A0..0x84D0D64F and 0x84D0D680..0x84D0D69F.",
   "desc": "(1) 0x84A7041C: the playbook-independent second pass accepts every package, not just special teams. (2) 0x84A70468 -> stub 0x84D0DC00: Trio (row 5) has no formation in MASTER, so it borrows formation 107 (Ace Trips Open). (3) 0x84A703EC: the second pass also runs in game (the stock code skips it in game, which is why Trio and a few others were missing there). (4) 0x84A70484 -> sort stub 0x84D0DC20 reorders the finished list with a rank table at 0x84D0DD00: Load, Jacks, Jokers, Pro Set, Queens, Ace, Kings, Flush, Trio, Straight, 5 Wide, Goalline, 5-2 Big, 4-3, 3-4, Nickel, Nickel 3-3, Dime, Dime 3-2, Prevent, Punt, Punt Return, Field Goal, Block FG, Kickoff, Kick Return, Onside Kickoff Team, Onside Kickoff Return Team (5) 0x84A707BC -> sort stub 0x84D0DD20: after the By Formation list is built, each formation is moved right behind the last earlier formation of its family (family table at 0x84D0DB00, generated from the game's own same-row test), so newly added formations sit with their parents; Hail Mary is left alone. Also uses 0x84D0DD20..0x84D0DE67, 0x84D0DB00..0x84D0DBAF and 0x84D0DC00..0x84D0DC13, 0x84D0DC20..0x84D0DCCF and 0x84D0DD00..0x84D0DD1F. Relocated by APF 2K8 Mod Studio from 0x84D0D580..0x84D0D64F, 0x84D0D680..0x84D0D69F, 0x84D0D6A0..0x84D0D7E7 (owned by the Studio's charge-abilities patch) into Studio-reserved space; branch offsets and the absolute table address were rewritten, every other word is unchanged.",
